OL,3,GNEWSAFounder aims to grow
OL,4,Aanti-loneliness pub project
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Dean Perryman's best friend Rob
OL,7,FClancy took his own life, he wanted to
OL,8,Fcreate something positive from an
OL,9,Funimaginable loss.
OL,11,FHis idea was simple; reserve an empty
OL,12,Fchair in a pub and invite anyone who
OL,13,Fneeded a conversation to sit down.
OL,15,FLess than 12 months since he started
OL,16,Fthe project to tackle loneliness, the
OL,17,Fmovement has gone global and his aim
OL,18,Fnow is to run an Empty Chairs event in
OL,19,Fevery UK constituency before the first
OL,20,Fanniversary of his friend's death on 21
OL,21,FNovember.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
