OL,3,GNEWSAFounder aims to grow
OL,4,Aanti-loneliness pub project
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I think everyone has just been really
OL,7,Ftouched by the idea that Rob's death
OL,8,Fnow has a legacy that has been able to
OL,9,Fgrow and has been able to spread
OL,10,Fkindness in such a powerful way,"
OL,11,FPerryman, from Hockley, Essex, said.
